          "mathHtml": "又2x＋y＝20，因此2×2r＋r＝20，解出r＝4<br>所以x＝2r＝2×4＝8，y＝r＝4<br>故(x－1)：(y＋1)之比值為<span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"mnum\">x－1</span><span class=\"mden\">y＋1</span></span>＝<span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"mnum\">8－1</span><span class=\"mden\">4＋1</span></span>＝ <span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"mnum\">7</span><span class=\"mden\">5</span></span>"
