      "qNum": 24,
      "examTag": "基91-1",
      "stem": "有甲、乙兩個完全相同的杯子，各裝不同量的水，若把甲杯中 <span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"mnum\">1</span><span class=\"mden\">5</span></span>的水倒進<br>乙杯，則兩杯的水位等高。設甲杯原來的水量為a，乙杯原來的水量為b，求 <span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"mnum\">b</span><span class=\"mden\">a</span></span>＝？【基91-1】",
      "stemFigs": [],
      "options": {
        "A": "<span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"mnum\">1</span><span class=\"mden\">5</span></span>",
        "B": "<span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"mnum\">3</span><span class=\"mden\">5</span></span>",
        "C": "<span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"mnum\">4</span><span class=\"mden\">5</span></span>",
        "D": "<span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"mnum\">5</span><span class=\"mden\">4</span></span>"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "rawAnswer": "B",
      "steps": [
        {
          "stepNum": 1,
          "speaker": "doraemon",
          "speakerName": "小叮噹",
          "gadget": "🔍 翻譯蒟蒻＋分析放大鏡",
          "intro": "別慌別慌！從百寶袋拿出「翻譯蒟蒻」，我們先把題目的條件列成數學式子看看：",
          "mathHtml": "把甲杯中 <span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"mnum\">1</span><span class=\"mden\">5</span></span>的水倒進乙杯<br>1"
        },
        {
          "stepNum": 2,
          "speaker": "shizuka",
          "speakerName": "宜靜",
          "gadget": "✏️ 電腦鉛筆",
          "intro": "大雄你看，接著我們用「電腦鉛筆」一步一步化簡、推導中間的關鍵步驟喔：",
          "mathHtml": "⇒甲杯還剩下(1－ 5 )a<br>乙杯則變成b＋ <span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"mnum\">1</span><span class=\"mden\">5</span></span>a，又水位等高表示水量相等，"
        },
        {
          "stepNum": 3,
          "speaker": "dorami",
          "speakerName": "小叮鈴",
          "gadget": "🔔 黃金鈴鐺驗證器",
          "intro": "最後一步囉！核對一下計算結果，就能鎖定正確答案 (B) 啦！",
          "mathHtml": "1<br>所以(1－ 5 )a＝b＋ <span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"mnum\">1</span><span class=\"mden\">5</span></span>a⇒<span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"mnum\">4</span><span class=\"mden\">5</span></span>a＝b＋ <span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"mnum\">1</span><span class=\"mden\">5</span></span>a⇒<span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"mnum\">4</span><span class=\"mden\">5</span></span>a－<br><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"mnum\">1</span><span class=\"mden\">5</span></span>a＝b⇒<span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"mnum\">3</span><span class=\"mden\">5</span></span>a＝b，移項得 <span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"mnum\">3</span><span class=\"mden\">5</span></span>＝ <span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"mnum\">b</span><span class=\"mden\">a</span></span>"
        }
      ],
      "expFigs": []
